{"3333850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arkheron", "steam_appid": 3333850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arkheron is a fast-paced PvP where items you loot define who you become. Teams of 3 scavenge Relics through looting and defeating monsters as you climb a dark, haunted Tower, build your playstyle on the fly, and outplay rival teams floor by floor for the right to ascend. What you carry defines everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Only Way Out is Up </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way up the Tower in Ascension mode — a series of escalating showdowns where only one team advances. Battle monsters, challenge rival teams, and seize beacons to ascend before time runs out. With each Ascension the player pool shrinks, until one final 3v3 at the summit decides who escapes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/6d05f5d07ba735b27e29c534908aef32.poster.avif?t=1787679087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/6d05f5d07ba735b27e29c534908aef32.webm?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/6d05f5d07ba735b27e29c534908aef32.mp4?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You Carry Defines You</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Tower, loot takes the form of Relics: powerful items that grant unique abilities and define how you fight. Swap them in and out as you climb, chasing new abilities and synergies in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Full Set: Collect all four matching Relics from a single set and gain the ability to transform into an Eternal and unlock a unique fifth ability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Shattered: Mix Relics from different sets to build something entirely your own. Unlock and combine set bonuses, discover unexpected combinations, and define your own playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/a78c64b469b17626df76b0dda4e849ad.poster.avif?t=1787679087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/a78c64b469b17626df76b0dda4e849ad.webm?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/a78c64b469b17626df76b0dda4e849ad.mp4?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High Stakes, Close Quarters Combat</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arkheron's isometric free-aim combat keeps you locked into the fight, swiveling to line up shots while dodging and striking at close range. The tight view makes every fight feel fast, strategic, and personal. Immersive audio heightens the tension: you'll hear the danger before you see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/bcd28ff4782e6d2758e4f942a7d1bf32.poster.avif?t=1787679087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/bcd28ff4782e6d2758e4f942a7d1bf32.webm?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/bcd28ff4782e6d2758e4f942a7d1bf32.mp4?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ever-Changing World </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charged emotions of the past create a world in constant flux. These shifting, distorted memories reshape the Tower and everything in it, as the haunting histories of the Eternals gradually unfold over time. This evolving narrative will add new layers of depth to the world around you as you fight to ascend the Tower once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/5d712c07fc15ced6d5c62bdc48897434.poster.avif?t=1787679087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/5d712c07fc15ced6d5c62bdc48897434.webm?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/5d712c07fc15ced6d5c62bdc48897434.mp4?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arkheron is a fast-paced PvP where items you loot define who you become. Teams of 3 scavenge Relics through looting and defeating monsters as you climb a dark, haunted Tower, build your playstyle on the fly, and outplay rival teams floor by floor for the right to ascend. What you carry defines everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Only Way Out is Up </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way up the Tower in Ascension mode — a series of escalating showdowns where only one team advances. Battle monsters, challenge rival teams, and seize beacons to ascend before time runs out. With each Ascension the player pool shrinks, until one final 3v3 at the summit decides who escapes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/6d05f5d07ba735b27e29c534908aef32.poster.avif?t=1787679087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/6d05f5d07ba735b27e29c534908aef32.webm?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/6d05f5d07ba735b27e29c534908aef32.mp4?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You Carry Defines You</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Tower, loot takes the form of Relics: powerful items that grant unique abilities and define how you fight. Swap them in and out as you climb, chasing new abilities and synergies in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Full Set: Collect all four matching Relics from a single set and gain the ability to transform into an Eternal and unlock a unique fifth ability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Shattered: Mix Relics from different sets to build something entirely your own. Unlock and combine set bonuses, discover unexpected combinations, and define your own playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/a78c64b469b17626df76b0dda4e849ad.poster.avif?t=1787679087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/a78c64b469b17626df76b0dda4e849ad.webm?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/a78c64b469b17626df76b0dda4e849ad.mp4?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High Stakes, Close Quarters Combat</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arkheron's isometric free-aim combat keeps you locked into the fight, swiveling to line up shots while dodging and striking at close range. The tight view makes every fight feel fast, strategic, and personal. Immersive audio heightens the tension: you'll hear the danger before you see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/bcd28ff4782e6d2758e4f942a7d1bf32.poster.avif?t=1787679087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/bcd28ff4782e6d2758e4f942a7d1bf32.webm?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/bcd28ff4782e6d2758e4f942a7d1bf32.mp4?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ever-Changing World </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charged emotions of the past create a world in constant flux. These shifting, distorted memories reshape the Tower and everything in it, as the haunting histories of the Eternals gradually unfold over time. This evolving narrative will add new layers of depth to the world around you as you fight to ascend the Tower once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/5d712c07fc15ced6d5c62bdc48897434.poster.avif?t=1787679087\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/5d712c07fc15ced6d5c62bdc48897434.webm?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/extras/5d712c07fc15ced6d5c62bdc48897434.mp4?t=1787679087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Fast-paced isometric team PVP looter where every item you find changes everything. Adapt your playstyle, build on the fly and fight your way up to the top of the Tower.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Italian, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/1982d7f95986ef6805d8620b3d13ce703e98bd0a/header.jpg?t=1787679087", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/14e80d9432ece7bad588e5975c21cecf6edc980f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787679087", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333850/14e80d9432ece7bad588e5975c21cecf6edc980f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787679087", "website": "https://www.arkheron.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K (or equivalent 6-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 6GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K (or equivalent 8-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2070 8GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<